<title>JAPAN: Takeda expected to post record group profit-paper.</title>
<headline>Takeda expected to post record group profit-paper.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmaceutical company Takeda Chemical Industries Ltd is expected to post a record group net profit of 70 billion yen in the year to March 31, 1997, due to robust sales in the United States and the weak yen, a Japanese business daily said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The estimate is 4.5 billion yen larger than the company&quot;s own forecast and 17 percent bigger than Takeda&quot;s actual group net profit in 1995/96, the Nihon Keizai Shimbun said.</p>
<p>Takeda was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
